course: dictionary
lesson: 8216
title: A reunion is a happy coming together
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: A reunion is when people who have been apart come together again. Think of the word in two parts: re- means again, and union means joining. «In Ohio, Lorcan goes to a family reunion, meets cousins he never knew he had, and plays baseball with them all day.» The clues are family, cousins he never knew he had, and all day. So a reunion is a gathering of people who have not seen each other for a long time.
explain: Reunions can be about food and tradition too. «The whole family folds dumplings together (bāo jiǎozi) and eats the reunion dinner (niányèfàn).» Here the reunion is the big family meal that brings everyone together. Ask yourself: who is coming together, and why? The answer shows you the meaning.
explain: Look for feelings in the words around the word. «A tearful reunion» means people crying as they meet again, so the meeting must matter a lot to them. «Zhōngqiū jié» is «a family reunion night second only to New Year», which shows that a reunion can be a special, important time for families.
fact: Reunion is a noun: a reunion, reunions.
fact: «Reunion» means a meeting of people who have not seen each other for a long time.
fact: «Reunion» can also mean coming together again after being apart, as in «a happy reunion».
fact: In a formal sense, «reunion» means joining two things back together, like countries or churches.
fact: Common phrases are «family reunion», «class reunion» and «a tearful reunion».
exercise: In Ohio, Lorcan goes to a family reunion and meets cousins he never knew he had. What is a reunion here? | A lesson at school | A party with a big cake | *A meeting of family who have been apart for a long time | A race around the park
exercise: «The whole family folds dumplings together and eats the reunion dinner.» What is the reunion dinner? | *A dinner where the family comes together | A dinner for only one person | A breakfast before school | A meal in a restaurant with strangers
exercise: «A tearful reunion» describes people meeting again. What does tearful tell you? | They are running a race | They are angry and shouting at each other | *They are crying, because the meeting means a lot to them | They are bored and sleepy
test: «The reunion was happy: the two friends hugged after ten years apart.» What does reunion mean here? | *Coming together again after being apart | A long holiday by the sea | A new school | A fight between friends
test: What does reunion mean in the formal sense? | A type of music | *Joining two things back together, like countries | Going on a long holiday | Splitting one thing into many parts
exam: «Zhōngqiū jié» is a family reunion night, second only to New Year. What does second only to New Year tell you? | It is the least important night of the year | It is a day for school trips | *It is the second most important night for families to come together | It is a night with no family at home
